        {
          "name": "comment",
          "value": "<p><strong>ORDER ANOMALY DETECTION WORKFLOW</strong></p><p>1. Extract order records from Salesforce.</p><p>2. Flatten nested Salesforce objects into model-ready columns.</p><p>3. Train an Isolation Forest model to learn normal order behavior.</p><p>4. Save the trained model for future reuse.</p><p>5. Score all orders using the trained model.</p><p>6. Generate anomaly scores and identify suspicious orders.</p><p>7. Display scored records for analyst review.</p><p><br></p><p>Goal:</p><p>Automatically detect unusual orders that may require investigation without needing labeled anomaly data.</p>",
          "widget": "textarea_rich"
        }
      ],
      "engine": "scala,pyspark,polars,agent",
      "inputAnchors": [],
      "outputAnchors": [],
      "agentTool": false
