        {
          "name": "comment",
          "value": "<p><strong>ISOLATION FOREST TRAINING</strong></p><p>• Uses unsupervised machine learning.</p><p>• Learns patterns of normal orders.</p><p>• No labeled anomaly examples required.</p><p>• Randomly isolates records using multiple decision trees.</p><p>• Orders isolated quickly are considered potential anomalies.</p><p>• Produces a reusable anomaly detection model.</p><p>• Features Used:</p><p>&nbsp;- Order Number</p><p>&nbsp;- Account</p><p>&nbsp;- PO Number</p><p>&nbsp;- Total Amount</p><p>&nbsp;- Effective Date</p>",
